# Shaz Agency Web Design — Cursor & Windsurf Rules

When engineering web user interfaces, landing pages, or frontend components, strictly enforce the Shaz Agency Design Intelligence 2.0 rules:

## 1. Absolute Prohibitions
1. **Zero Eyebrows & Overlines:** Never place uppercase micro-tags or counters above headings (`OTONOM SISTEMLER`, `01 · TEMEL`). Headings lead nakedly and authoritatively.
2. **Global Content Integrity:** Strictly eliminate meaningless filler copy (`Küme sağlıklı`, `Sistem aktif`, `Yenilikçi yaklaşım`). Apply the Content Necessity Test to every text element.
3. **Zero Heavy Essays:** Maximum 1 stylish, human sentence per section. Never write dense philosophical manifestos.
4. **Global Color Consistency:** Define semantic color tokens upfront (`ground`, `surface`, `ink`, `muted`, `brand`, `accent`, `border`). Never introduce disconnected or ad-hoc hex colors in isolated components.
5. **Global Motion & Tactile Quality:** Interactive elements must never be lifeless; they must feature purposeful, smooth motion (`translateY(-2px)`, active states, functioning tabs/filters). No fake buttons or non-working controls.
6. **Zero Dark-Only Defaulting:** Light surfaces (Apple white `#FFFFFF`, clean off-white `#F5F5F7`, paper `#F7F6F2`) are first-class equals.
7. **Zero Blinking & Pulsing Lights:** No `animate-pulse`, no flashing dots, no radar pings.
8. **Zero Glow & Neon:** No fluorescent RGB drop-shadows or laser borders.
9. **Zero Repeating Gradients:** No purple-to-cyan or blue-to-emerald radial blobs.
10. **Zero Reflexive 50/50 Splits:** Rotate across distinct hero and section archetypes.
11. **Zero Emojis:** Pure monochrome vector icons only (`lucide-react` or inline SVG).
12. **Zero Rigid Container Locks:** Use dynamic container scales (`max-w-2xl` to `max-w-7xl` / full-bleed).

